      "answers": {
        "answer_snippet": "f(x) = [3x^(2/3) / 2] - [3x^(4/3) / 4] + c. Using f(8) = 5 gives c = 5. Final answer: f(x) = 3x^(2/3) - (3/4)x^(4/3) + 5"
