          "syllabus_outcomes": ["1.3"],
          "answers": {
            "answer_snippet": "Mid-point of AB = (6.5, -0.5). Center C = (-1, 2). Perpendicular distance r² = (-1 - 6.5)² + (2 + 0.5)² = 62.5. Equation: (x + 1)² + (y - 2)² = 62.5 or 62½"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_number": "7",
      "subparts": ["a", "b"],
      "page": 10,
      "marks": 7,
      "syllabus_outcomes": ["1.5"],
      "topic": "Trigonometry - Identities and equations",
      "subpart_details": [
        {
          "subpart": "a",
          "marks": 4,
          "syllabus_outcomes": ["1.5"],
          "answers": {
            "answer_snippet": "Obtain common denominator (cos θ - 2sin θ)(cos θ + 2sin θ). Numerator simplifies to 4(cos²θ + sin²θ). Denominator = cos²θ - 4sin²θ = cos²θ - 4(1 - cos²θ) = 5cos²θ - 4. Hence 4/(5cos²θ - 4). [AG]"
          }
        },
        {
          "subpart": "b",
          "marks": 3,
          "syllabus_outcomes": ["1.5"],
          "answers": {
            "answer_snippet": "4/(5cos²θ - 4) = 5 leading to 25cos²θ = 24, cos θ = ±√(24/25) = ±0.9798. θ = 11.5° or 168.5°"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "question_number": "8",
      "subparts": ["a", "b"],
      "page": 12,
      "marks": 8,
      "syllabus_outcomes": ["1.3", "1.8"],
      "topic": "Coordinate geometry and Integration - Volume of revolution",
      "subpart_details": [
        {
          "subpart": "a",
          "marks": 3,
          "syllabus_outcomes": ["1.3"],
          "answers": {
            "answer_snippet": "Chord parallel to x-axis at y = 2. Substitute into circle: (x - 2)² + 4 = 8 giving x = 4. Points: A = (0, 2), B = (4, 2)"
          }
        },
        {
          "subpart": "b",
          "marks": 5,
          "syllabus_outcomes": ["1.8"],
          "answers": {
            "answer_snippet": "Volume = π∫[8 - (x - 2)²]dx from 0 to 4. Integral = π[8x - (x - 2)³/3]. Apply limits: π[32 - 16/3] - 0. Volume of cylinder = π × 2² × 4 = 16π. Volume of revolution = 26⅔π - 16π = 10⅔π or 33.5"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
