            "answer_snippet": "tan A = 12/5 or cos A = 5/13 or sin A = 12/13. A = 1.176, B = 0.3948. DE = 4. Arcs = 5 × 1.176 + 8 × 0.3948. Perimeter = 5.880 + 3.158 + 4 = 13.0"
